 금액) 적용\n 5) 예식 29일부터 10일 이전 취소 시: 예식 비용의 50%(계약금 금액 포함) 적용\n 6) 예식 9일부터 4일 이전 취소시: 예식 비용의 70%(계약금 포함 금액) 적용\n 7) 예식 3일 이전부터 당일 취소 시: 예식 비용의 100%(계약금 포함 금액) 적용\n※위약금 산정기준은 소비자 및 사업자 귀책사유 모두 동일하게 적용"}],"conditions":[{"id":"venue-31436-p-0-condition","evidenceIds":["venue-31436-e-0"],"disclosureId":"d-venue-31436","interpretation":"unreviewed","label":"공시 적용 조건","rawText":"50 ~ 600명","expression":{"op":"raw","text":"50 ~ 600명"}},{"id":"venue-31436-p-1-condition","evidenceIds":["venue-31436-e-1"],"disclosureId":"d-venue-31436","interpretation":"unreviewed","label":"공시 적용 조건","rawText":"50 ~ 600명","expression":{"op":"raw","text":"50 ~ 600명"}},{"id":"venue-31436-p-2-condition","evidenceIds":["venue-31436-e-2"],"disclosureId":"d-venue-31436","interpretation":"unreviewed","label":"공시 적용 조건","rawText":"20~ 30명","expression":{"op":"raw","text":"20~ 30명"}},{"id":"venue-31436-p-3-condition","evidenceIds":["venue-31436-e-3"],"disclosureId":"d-venue-31436","interpretation":"unreviewed","label":"공시 적용 조건","rawText":"20~ 30명","expression":{"op":"raw","text":"20~ 30명"}},{"id":"venue-31436-p-4-condition","evidenceIds":["venue-31436-e-4"],"disclosureId":"d-venue-31436","interpretation":"unreviewed","label":"공시 적용 조건","rawText":"50 ~ 100명","expression":{"op":"raw","text":"50 ~ 100명"}},{"id":"venue-31436-p-5-condition","evidenceIds":["venue-31436-e-5"],"disclosureId":"d-venue-31436","interpretation":"unreviewed","label":"공시 적용 조건","rawText":"50 ~ 100명","expression":{"op":"raw","text":"50 ~ 100명"}}],"facts":[{"id":"venue-31436-fact-address","evidenceIds":["venue-31436-metadata"],"disclosureId":"d-venue-31436","interpretation":"unreviewed","subjectId":"venue-31436","predicate":"location:address","valueState":"known","value":"제주특별자치도 제주시 애월읍 애월해안도로 394","rawText":"제주특별자치도 제주시 애월읍 애월해안도로 394"},{"id":"venue-31436-fact-phone","evidenceIds":["venue-31436-metadata"],"disclosureId":"d-venue-31436","interpretation":"unreviewed","subjectId":"venue-31436","predicate":"contact:phone","valueState":"